{
  "description": "With auto-continue off, a provider that keeps failing makes the run exit with the provider exit code (4) and the provider's message on stderr, so a script can tell an outage from a bad key (3) or a bug (1). (With it on, the default, an outage is retried on a schedule: see 100.)",
  "prompt": "Say hello.",
  "script": [
    {
      "status": 500,
